cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tchem, please cite it as below."
title: "Tussl Chemistry (tchem): names a single-cell RNA library's layout from its first reads"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tussl Ltd"
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tussl-Co/TusslChemistry"
abstract: >-
  tchem names a single-cell RNA library's kit, chemistry, barcode list, cDNA strand and library
  type from the first reads of its FASTQ or BAM files, across vendors, and prints how far to
  trust the answer: each layout's record on held-out public runs.
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - bioinformatics
  - fastq
  - chemistry detection
  - barcodes
